repository: https://github.com/ashenoy00000/fda-strategy-triples
abstract: >
  A curated, human-reviewed dataset of (gene → variant_context → FDA-approved drug →
  molecular_target → mechanism) tuples for rare diseases. Each record is extracted
  from FDA Structured Product Labels via Claude (Anthropic), cross-validated against
  ChEMBL and DrugBank, and signed off by a domain expert before inclusion in the
  validated dataset. Version 0.1.0 covers 10 validated records across SMA, cystic
  fibrosis, Fabry disease, hATTR amyloidosis, ALS, sickle cell disease, beta-thalassemia,
  acute hepatic porphyria, progeria, and hypercholesterolaemia.
